                <pb facs="0203" n="196" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg196"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No.
                    121—Cablegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Madriz to Mr. Guzman.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-21"><hi rendition="#italic">November 21,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: British Minister Gosling declares that
                    England does not accept Nicaraguan rule in Mosquito.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Madriz.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
